msgstr "无法导入 Isaac Lab 包"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:29
msgid ""
"A ``ModuleNotFoundError`` naming an Isaac Lab package almost always means "
"the command is not running inside the Isaac Lab environment, rather than "
"that the package was skipped at install time. Most packages cannot be "
"deselected at all."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``ModuleNotFoundError`` 指向某个 Isaac Lab 包，几乎总是因为命令没有在 Isaac Lab "
"环境中运行，而非安装时漏装了该包。大多数包在安装时根本无法排除。"

