#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:43
msgid ""
"Core packages. Every ``isaaclab install`` run installs them as editable "
"packages and there is no way to opt out, so the error points at the "
"environment rather than at the install command."
msgstr ""
"核心包。每次运行 ``isaaclab install`` "
"都会以可编辑模式安装它们，且无法选择不安装。因此，这类错误说明环境有问题，而非安装命令有问题。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:46
msgid "``isaaclab_mimic``, ``isaaclab_teleop``"
msgstr "``isaaclab_mimic``, ``isaaclab_teleop``"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:47
msgid ""
"Optional packages. ``isaaclab install`` (equivalently ``isaaclab install "
"all``) includes them; ``isaaclab install core`` does not."
msgstr ""
"可选包。 ``isaaclab install`` （等同于 ``isaaclab install all`` ）会安装它们， ``isaaclab "
"install core`` 则不会。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:49
msgid "``rsl_rl``, ``rl_games``, ``skrl``, ``stable_baselines3``"
msgstr "``rsl_rl``, ``rl_games``, ``skrl``, ``stable_baselines3``"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:50
msgid ""
"Reinforcement learning frameworks, installed by the ``rl`` feature. They are"
" part of the default install; ``isaaclab install 'rl[rsl-rl]'`` installs a "
"single framework."
msgstr ""
"强化学习框架，由 ``rl`` 功能组安装，属于默认安装范围。 ``isaaclab install 'rl[rsl-rl]'`` 只安装一个框架。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:52
msgid "``isaacsim``"
msgstr "``isaacsim``"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:53
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim itself, which is never installed implicitly. See "
":ref:`troubleshooting-isaacsim-missing`."
msgstr "Isaac Sim 本身，它从不会被隐式安装。参阅 :ref:`troubleshooting-isaacsim-missing` 。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:56
msgid ""
"First check whether the package resolves in the uv-managed environment, from"
" the repository root:"
msgstr "先在仓库根目录检查 uv 管理的环境能否找到该包："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:63
msgid ""
"If that succeeds but your own command fails, the command is running against "
"a different interpreter. Re-run it through ``uv run`` from the repository "
"root:"
msgstr "如果检查成功，但您自己的命令仍失败，说明该命令使用了其他解释器。请从仓库根目录通过 ``uv run`` 重新运行："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:70
msgid ""
"If the import fails under ``uv run`` as well, recreate the documented "
"source-install environment for your workflow."
msgstr "如果通过 ``uv run`` 也无法导入，请按对应工作流的源代码安装文档重新创建环境。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:75
msgid ""
"The ``ov``, ``contrib`` and ``tetrahedralization`` features are deliberately"
" excluded from the default install and must be requested explicitly, for "
"example ``isaaclab install 'ov[ovrtx]'``."
msgstr ""
"``ov`` 、 ``contrib`` 和 ``tetrahedralization`` 功能组有意不包含在默认安装中，需要显式指定，例如 "
"``isaaclab install 'ov[ovrtx]'`` 。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:82
msgid "Isaac Sim is not installed"
msgstr "未安装 Isaac Sim"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:84
msgid ""
"``ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'isaacsim'`` means a script that "
"requires Isaac Sim was launched without it. Either install Isaac Sim:"
msgstr ""
"``ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'isaacsim'`` 表示启动了需要 Isaac Sim "
"的脚本，但环境中没有安装它。可以安装 Isaac Sim："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:91
msgid "or run a Newton-based task, which does not need Kit:"
msgstr "也可以运行基于 Newton 的任务，这类任务不需要 Kit："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:97
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/setup/quickstart` for the full list of ``physics=`` and "
"``renderer=`` selectors and the extras each one requires."
msgstr ""
"完整的 ``physics=`` 和 ``renderer=`` 选择项，以及各项所需的额外依赖，见 "
":doc:`/source/setup/quickstart` 。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:101
msgid "Dependency version conflicts during installation"
msgstr "安装时出现依赖版本冲突"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:103
msgid ""
"During pip or uv installs, the package manager may print dependency warnings"
" of the form ``<package> requires <version>, but <other-package> requires "
"<version>``, where an Isaac Lab package, an Isaac Sim package, or a third-"
"party package declares an incompatible constraint. Common examples include "
"``coverage``, ``packaging``, ``numpy``, or ``Pillow`` constraints reported "
"between ``isaaclab``, ``isaacsim-kernel``, ``isaacsim-core``, ``nvidia-srl-"
"usd``, and ``moviepy``."
msgstr ""
"使用 pip 或 uv 安装时，包管理器可能显示类似 ``<package> requires <version>, but <other-"
"package> requires <version>`` 的依赖警告，表示某个 Isaac Lab 包、Isaac Sim "
"包或第三方包声明了不兼容的版本约束。常见例子是 ``isaaclab`` 、 ``isaacsim-kernel`` 、 ``isaacsim-"
"core`` 、 ``nvidia-srl-usd`` 和 ``moviepy`` 之间报告的 ``coverage`` 、 ``packaging``"
" 、 ``numpy`` 或 ``Pillow`` 版本约束。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:110
msgid ""
"These messages are generally benign when the install command completes "
"successfully. They usually reflect package metadata that is stricter or "
"older than the versions bundled and tested with Isaac Sim. Prefer starting "
"from a fresh virtual environment and using the installation commands in the "
"Isaac Lab docs. If the resolver aborts with ``No solution found``, or the "
"installation leaves missing modules at runtime, recreate the environment and"
" install the documented Isaac Sim version before installing Isaac Lab."
msgstr ""
"如果安装命令成功完成，这些提示通常不会造成问题。它们往往说明包元数据中的约束比 Isaac Sim "
"附带并经过测试的版本更严格或更陈旧。建议从全新的虚拟环境开始，并使用 Isaac Lab 文档中的安装命令。如果依赖解析器以 ``No solution"
" found`` 中止，或安装后运行时仍有模块缺失，请重新创建环境，并先安装文档指定版本的 Isaac Sim，再安装 Isaac Lab。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:118
msgid "GLIBC is too old"
msgstr "GLIBC 版本过旧"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:120
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim pip packages require GLIBC 2.35 or newer. Check your version with "
"``ldd --version``. Ubuntu 22.04 and later satisfy this. On older "
"distributions, use the `binary installation "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_workstation.html>`_"
" method for Isaac Sim instead."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim 的 pip 包要求 GLIBC 2.35 或更新版本。使用 ``ldd --version`` 检查版本。Ubuntu 22.04 "
"及更新版本满足要求。较旧的发行版应改用 Isaac Sim 的 `二进制安装 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_workstation.html>`_"
" 方式。"

