#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:169
msgid "GPU buffer capacity errors"
msgstr "GPU 缓冲区容量错误"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:171
msgid ""
"When using the GPU pipeline, the buffers used for the physics simulation are"
" allocated on the GPU only once at the start of the simulation. They do not "
"grow dynamically as the number of collisions or objects in the scene "
"changes. If the scene exceeds the size of a buffer, the simulation fails "
"with an error such as:"
msgstr ""
"使用 GPU 流水线时，物理仿真的缓冲区只在仿真开始时于 GPU "
"上分配一次，不会随着场景中的碰撞或对象数量变化而动态扩容。如果场景超出某个缓冲区的容量，仿真就会失败，并报告如下错误："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:181
msgid ""
"Raise the matching field on the physics configuration for the backend you "
"are running. The field is named after the PhysX parameter — for the error "
"above it is "
":attr:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg.gpu_found_lost_pairs_capacity`:"
msgstr ""
"请增大当前后端物理配置中对应字段的值。字段名与 PhysX 参数一致；对于上述错误，对应的是 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg.gpu_found_lost_pairs_capacity` ："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:194
msgid ""
"The same field exists on :class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` for the "
"``ovphysx`` backend. Inside a task, set it on the task's preset so that both"
" PhysX backends stay in sync:"
msgstr ""
"``ovphysx`` 后端的 :class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` "
"中也有同名字段。在任务中，应通过任务的预设进行设置，让两个 PhysX 后端保持一致："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:212
msgid ""
"The defaults are already large, so only raise a capacity when PhysX "
"explicitly asks for it. Please see :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` for "
"the other parameters that configure the simulation."
msgstr ""
"默认容量已经较大，因此只有在 PhysX 明确要求时才应增大。其他仿真配置参数见 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` 。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:218
msgid "Newton backends"
msgstr "Newton 后端"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:220
msgid ""
"These entries apply to the ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` and "
"``physics=newton_kamino`` backends."
msgstr "以下条目适用于 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` 和 ``physics=newton_kamino`` 后端。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:225
msgid "Simulation or training runs slower than expected"
msgstr "仿真或训练速度低于预期"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:227
msgid ""
"Start with a representative profile before changing physics or rendering "
"settings. The :doc:`Nsight Systems profiling guide <../how-"
"to/profile_with_nsys>` can help distinguish time spent in physics, "
"rendering, environment code, and policy inference."
msgstr ""
"调整物理或渲染设置之前，先对有代表性的运行过程进行性能分析。 :doc:`Nsight Systems 性能分析指南 <../how-"
"to/profile_with_nsys>` 可以帮助区分物理计算、渲染、环境代码和策略推理各自的耗时。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:231
msgid "For PhysX workloads, check the following common causes:"
msgstr "对于 PhysX 工作负载，请检查以下常见原因："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:233
msgid ""
"**Unneeded visualization:** Commands that do not select a visualizer launch "
"without a viewer by default. If a configuration would otherwise launch one, "
"pass ``--viz none`` to disable it."
msgstr "**不必要的可视化：** 未选择可视化器的命令默认不启动查看器。如果配置原本会启动查看器，可传入 ``--viz none`` 将其关闭。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:235
msgid ""
"**Excessive collision work:** Avoid duplicated or overlapping collision "
"geometry and use the simplest collider that provides the required fidelity."
msgstr "**过多的碰撞计算：** 避免重复或重叠的碰撞几何体，在满足所需精度的前提下使用最简单的碰撞体。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:237
msgid ""
"**GPU collider fallbacks:** A warning that a convex mesh failed to cook as "
"GPU-compatible means its collision handling falls back to the CPU. Replace "
"the collider with a primitive or bounding box approximation when possible. A"
" static triangle mesh is another option only when the geometry is not part "
"of a dynamic rigid body."
msgstr ""
"**GPU 碰撞体回退：** 如果警告提示凸网格无法预处理为 GPU 兼容形式，它的碰撞计算会回退到 "
"CPU。尽可能用基本几何体或包围盒近似替代该碰撞体。静态三角网格也是一种选择，但仅适用于不属于动态刚体的几何体。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:242
msgid ""
"For broader tuning guidance, including CPU/GPU selection, solver settings, "
"rendering, sensors, and CPU configuration, consult the maintained upstream "
"guides:"
msgstr "更全面的调优建议，包括 CPU/GPU 选择、求解器设置、渲染、传感器及 CPU 配置，见持续维护的上游指南："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:245
msgid ""
"`Isaac Sim Performance Optimization Handbook "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/reference_material/sim_performance_optimization_handbook.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Isaac Sim性能优化手册 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/reference_material/sim_performance_optimization_handbook.html>`_"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:247
msgid ""
"`Omni Physics Simulation Performance Guide "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/latest/dev_guide/guides/physics-"
"performance.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Omni物理仿真性能指南 "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/latest/dev_guide/guides/physics-"
"performance.html>`_"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:250
msgid ""
"For Newton-specific performance and solver parameters, see the :ref:`Newton "
"physics documentation <physics-backends-newton>`."
msgstr "Newton 专用的性能设置与求解器参数，见 :ref:`Newton 物理文档 <physics-backends-newton>` 。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:255
msgid "Joints actuate in PhysX but not in a Newton-based backend"
msgstr "关节在 PhysX 中能被驱动，在基于 Newton 的后端中却不能"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:257
msgid ""
"Newton resolves target modes for joints covered by an Isaac Lab actuator "
"configuration before constructing the solver. For an "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ImplicitActuatorCfg`, stiffness-only, damping-"
"only, both-gain, and zero-gain configurations select position, velocity, "
"combined position/velocity, and effort modes respectively. ``None`` retains "
"the corresponding imported USD gain. Explicit actuator configurations use "
"effort mode because Isaac Lab computes their effort directly."
msgstr ""
"Newton 会在构造求解器之前，为 Isaac Lab 执行器配置所覆盖的关节确定目标模式。对于 "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ImplicitActuatorCfg` "
"，仅有刚度、仅有阻尼、两种增益均有以及两种增益均为零的配置，分别对应位置、速度、位置与速度组合、驱动力模式。 ``None`` 表示保留从 USD "
"导入的对应增益。显式执行器配置采用驱动力模式，因为 Isaac Lab 会直接计算其驱动力。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:265
msgid ""
"Joints not covered by an Isaac Lab actuator configuration retain their "
"imported USD target modes. Thus, zero-gain USD drives no longer require "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.JointDrivePropertiesCfg.ensure_drives_exist` "
"solely to make a configured joint actuate in Newton. The option remains "
"available for workflows that need to author placeholder drives independently"
" of an Isaac Lab actuator configuration. See :ref:`import-new-asset-ensure-"
"drives-exist` for details."
msgstr ""
"未被 Isaac Lab 执行器配置覆盖的关节，会保留从 USD 导入的目标模式。因此，对于已配置的关节，即使 USD "
"驱动增益为零，也不再需要仅为了让它在 Newton 中被驱动而设置 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.JointDrivePropertiesCfg.ensure_drives_exist` "
"。该选项仍可用于不依赖 Isaac Lab 执行器配置、单独写入占位驱动的工作流。详见 :ref:`import-new-asset-ensure-"
"drives-exist` 。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:275
msgid "Renderers and visualizers"
msgstr "渲染器与可视化器"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:278
msgid "Crash in ``libusd_tf`` / USD symbol collision with OVRTX"
msgstr "OVRTX 的 ``libusd_tf`` 崩溃或 USD 符号冲突"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:280
msgid ""
"If you see a crash involving ``libusd_tf-*.so`` and conflicting USD versions"
" (e.g. ``pxrInternal_v0_25_5`` vs ``pxrInternal_v0_25_11``):"
msgstr ""
"如果崩溃涉及 ``libusd_tf-*.so`` ，并出现 USD 版本冲突（例如 ``pxrInternal_v0_25_5`` 与 "
"``pxrInternal_v0_25_11`` ）："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:283
msgid ""
"Ensure ``LD_PRELOAD`` is set to ovrtx's ``libcarb.so`` and install the OVRTX"
" runtime with ``./isaaclab.sh -i 'ov[ovrtx]'`` (see :ref:`modularized "
"installation <installation-selective-install>`)"
msgstr ""
"确保 ``LD_PRELOAD`` 指向 ovrtx 的 ``libcarb.so`` ，并使用 ``./isaaclab.sh -i "
"'ov[ovrtx]'`` 安装 OVRTX 运行时（见 :ref:`模块化安装 <installation-selective-install>` "
"）。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:285
msgid ""
"Ensure ``isaacsim`` / ``omniverse-kit`` is **not** installed in the same "
"environment — their bundled USD libraries conflict with ovrtx's"
msgstr ""
"确保同一环境中 **没有** 安装 ``isaacsim`` / ``omniverse-kit`` ，它们附带的 USD 库会与 ovrtx "
"的库冲突。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:289
msgid "The Newton visualizer window does not appear"
msgstr "Newton 可视化窗口没有出现"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:291
msgid ""
"The Newton interactive viewer needs ``imgui-bundle``, which is a base "
"dependency of Isaac Lab. In a uv-managed environment it is always present, "
"so a missing window normally points at the display rather than the package. "
"If you are running in an environment that was not built from the Isaac Lab "
"dependency set, install it explicitly:"
msgstr ""
"Newton 交互式查看器需要 ``imgui-bundle`` ，它是 Isaac Lab 的基本依赖。在 uv "
"管理的环境中，该包始终存在，因此窗口没有出现通常是显示环境有问题，而非缺少软件包。如果运行环境并非按 Isaac Lab 的依赖集创建，请显式安装："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:301
msgid "The viser visualizer serves a web UI instead of opening a window"
msgstr "viser 可视化器提供 Web 界面，不会打开窗口"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:303
msgid ""
"``--visualizer viser`` does not open a native window. Check the terminal for"
" the served URL; the default port is ``8080``, configurable through "
":attr:`~isaaclab_visualizers.ViserVisualizerCfg.port`. The ``viser`` package"
" ships in the ``viser`` extra."
msgstr ""
"``--visualizer viser`` 不会打开原生窗口。请在终端中查看服务地址；默认端口为 ``8080`` ，可通过 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_visualizers.ViserVisualizerCfg.port` 配置。 ``viser`` 包包含在 "
"``viser`` 额外依赖中。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:310
msgid "Livestreaming and WebRTC"
msgstr "直播与 WebRTC"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:313
msgid ""
"``NVST_R_BUSY`` / ``NVST_R_INTERNAL_ERROR`` on ``LIVESTREAM=1`` or "
"``LIVESTREAM=2``"
msgstr ""
"设置 ``LIVESTREAM=1`` 或 ``LIVESTREAM=2`` 时出现 ``NVST_R_BUSY`` / "
"``NVST_R_INTERNAL_ERROR``"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:315
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitLauncher` pins TCP port ``49100`` for WebRTC "
"signaling whenever ``LIVESTREAM=1`` (public network) or ``LIVESTREAM=2`` "
"(private network) is set. If a previous livestream process is still bound to"
" that port, the new session fails to start with:"
msgstr ""
"设置 ``LIVESTREAM=1`` （公网）或 ``LIVESTREAM=2`` （私网）时， "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitLauncher` 会固定使用 TCP 端口 ``49100`` 进行 WebRTC "
"信令通信。如果之前的直播进程仍占用该端口，新会话就无法启动，并报错："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:324
msgid ""
"or, less commonly, ``NVST_R_INTERNAL_ERROR`` while binding the signaling "
"socket. Identify the process holding port 49100, confirm it is safe to stop,"
" then terminate it and relaunch:"
msgstr ""
"也可能在绑定信令套接字时出现较少见的 ``NVST_R_INTERNAL_ERROR`` 。找到占用端口 49100 "
"的进程，确认可以安全停止后，终止它并重新启动："

