#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:351
msgid "Distributed training"
msgstr "分布式训练"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:354
msgid "NCCL errors during multi-GPU training"
msgstr "多 GPU 训练中的 NCCL 错误"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:356
msgid ""
"On some Linux multi-GPU systems, distributed training may fail with ``CUDA "
"error: an illegal memory access was encountered`` reported by "
"``ProcessGroupNCCL``. For documented NCCL workarounds, see :ref:`multi-gpu-"
"nccl-troubleshooting`."
msgstr ""
"在某些 Linux 多 GPU 系统上，分布式训练可能会失败，并由 ``ProcessGroupNCCL`` 报出 ``CUDA error: an "
"illegal memory access was encountered`` 。有关已记录的 NCCL 变通方法，请参见 :ref:`multi-"
"gpu-nccl-troubleshooting` 。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:362
msgid "Debugging and diagnostics"
msgstr "调试与诊断"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:365
msgid "Checking the internal logs from the simulator"
msgstr "从仿真器的内部日志中检查"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:367
msgid ""
"When running a Kit-based workflow from a standalone script, the simulator "
"logs warnings and errors to the terminal. At the same time, it also logs "
"internal messages to a file. These are useful for debugging and "
"understanding the internal state of the simulator. Depending on your system,"
" the log file can be found in the locations listed `here "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_faq.html#common-"
"path-locations>`_."
msgstr ""
"通过独立脚本运行基于 Kit "
"的工作流时，仿真器会把警告和错误输出到终端，同时将内部消息写入日志文件。这些信息有助于调试和了解仿真器的内部状态。日志位置因系统而异，详见 `常用路径 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/installation/install_faq.html#common-"
"path-locations>`_ 。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:373
msgid ""
"To obtain the exact location of the log file, check the first few lines of "
"the terminal output when you run the standalone script. The log file "
"location is printed at the start of the terminal output, on a line of the "
"form:"
msgstr "要确定日志文件的具体位置，请查看运行独立脚本时终端输出的前几行。日志路径会在输出开头以如下形式显示："

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:381
msgid ""
"You can open this file to check the internal logs from the simulator. When "
"reporting issues, please include this log file to help us debug the issue."
msgstr "可以打开该文件查看仿真器的内部日志。报告问题时，请附上日志文件，以帮助我们排查。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:385
msgid "Changing logging channel levels for the simulator"
msgstr "更改仿真器的日志记录通道级别"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:387
msgid ""
"By default, the simulator logs messages at the ``WARN`` level and above on "
"the terminal. You can change the logging channel levels to get more detailed"
" logs. The logging channel levels can be set through Omniverse's logging "
"system."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，仿真器在终端上记录 ``WARN`` 级别及以上的消息。您可以更改日志通道级别以获得更详细的日志。日志通道级别可以通过 Omniverse "
"的日志系统进行设置。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:390
msgid ""
"To obtain more detailed logs, you can run your application with the "
"following flags:"
msgstr "要获取更详细的日志，您可以使用以下标志运行应用程序:"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:392
msgid "``--info``: This flag logs messages at the ``INFO`` level and above."
msgstr "``--info``: 此标志记录 ``INFO`` 级别及以上的消息。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:393
msgid ""
"``--verbose``: This flag logs messages at the ``VERBOSE`` level and above."
msgstr "``--verbose``: 此标志记录 ``VERBOSE`` 级别及以上的消息。"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:395
msgid ""
"For instance, to run a standalone script with verbose logging, you can use "
"the following command:"
msgstr "例如，要以详细记录方式运行独立脚本，可以使用以下命令:"

#: source/refs/troubleshooting.rst:413
msgid ""
"For more fine-grained control, you can modify the logging channels through "
"the ``logger`` module. For more information, please refer to its "
"`documentation <https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"要进行更精细的控制，您可以通过 ``logger`` 模块修改日志通道。有关更多信息，请参阅其 `文档 "
"<https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.html>`__ 。"

